Z||000007||EdsB52||07-03-2001||07:05 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DRH:<BR><B>Still think you're in debate class, huh? You can't win this one. Every time you post you just look more desperate. Have you seen anybody jump in on your side lately? Sometimes when it seems like everybody is against you it's because you're WRONG.<P>I'm suprised your user id still works. How do you explain that? Kinda goes against your theories.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>I know I can't win this one, nor do I want to. I just want to state my point, you guys want to win, and that’s why you ban together. Also there is apparently a fear of this club being taken away so you feel if you join Cliff and Archie that it won't happen. Not real brave, but a good idea.<P>Sometimes when everyone is against you it is because you are wrong, I agree. And sometimes it's because a more attractive agenda exists. Many people in this forum are afraid that Cliff will remove this club. Is that a reason to rally around him regardless of the facts? Yes. Doesn't mean anyone in specific is right, just that the agenda overwhelms the facts. <P>Someone emailed me this morning with a few subsequent emails. Someone posted that my questions were valid a couple hours ago. Is that recent? Of the more than 2,000 members, how many have jumped on the bandwagon? A fraction of .1%.  Is that really damning?<P>He then wrote;<P>"I'm suprised your user id still works. How do you explain that? Kinda goes against your theories."<P>Oh, contraire, Cliff looks bad for not answering why he protected Archie but not Lisa, and would look even worse if he removed my user ID. Not to say he won't, as his cheerleaders are all in line, but an objective group would certainly be questioning his motives.||||reg||1
