Z||000015||kslish||07-03-2001||07:50 PM||||Oh man, I can't believe this has come to this.  As many people from this forum who know me (Roger, Lisa, Denny, Scott, Corinne and so on...their forum names are pretty useless now) know that I probably don't have a negative bone in my body however I have managed to get quite ticked off by witnessing what has occurred over the past 24 hours.  It's a bigger loss than some probably realize.  I know that I have become good friends with some of the people from here, and have received much help (and parts) for my Fiero over the past year or so. <P>Ed....before you go talking about not bowing down to authority...go spend some time in a country where you don't have that choice for a while.  Then lecture us on free speech/free will and how things should work okay?  <P>When it comes down to it, on this board it's Cliff's choice and we all have to live with it....I know I will.  99% of us realized that when we joined this forum.  <P>I'm sure you will post something to debate what I have said, and that's fine.  However, this will be the last post from me on this subject, hopefully everyone can be man enough to put this behind them and move on, with or without the forum.  Is it really so hard to just let this go?<P><P>------------------<BR>Ken S.<BR>'87GT and '86SC<BR>See them at <A HREF="http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html" TARGET=_blank>http://homepage.mac.com/kjslish/Fiero.html</A><BR>Western PA Fiero Club - <A HREF="http://www.westpennfiero.org" TARGET=_blank>www.westpennfiero.org</A>||||reg||1
