Z||000022||Seanh||07-03-2001||08:48 PM||||Has this Ed retard be banned yet? If not I must ask why. Like has been said so many times, He's obviously crossed the line, and should not be allowed here. If only his mommy knew.....<P>I did however get the biggest kick outta this guy try to tell Cliff how to run his forum. Acusing him of advertising on his own forum. Hmm...Yeah, I guess its not his place to advertise here since its not like he pays for it or anything...Oh wait, He does pay for it, doesn't he? So Ed, whats so wrong with him advertising on his own forum? I see no problem with try to recoupe some of the massive expenses associated with operating a forum of this magnitude.<P>I think Mach10 put it pretty damn well...||||reg||1
Z||000026||firstfiero||07-03-2001||09:25 PM||||    since I am a daily poster in this forum I would just like to throw my 2 cents in...<P>1) I don't understand what the problem is with advertising. He gives us this wonderful place to enjoy our favoite car together...for the big price of FREE! I don't care if he's making 1000 dollars a day....which he's not....he created this why shouldn't he be able to at the very least explore avenues to help ofset the costs. <BR>2) About him censoring....ITS HIS FORUM! If you have a better idea for a board then by all means go for it. All I'm saying is this is like his house he has the right to set the rules. If you come in my home and say something I don't like I can throw you the hell out. You can cry about free speech all you want but you'll be doing it on the curb. This isn't a forum ran by some goverment agency. Freedom of speech doesn't apply. This is ran by a private individual that has the right to cut what ever he wants. I'm not saying this as a threat but if you don't like it leave. The rest of us enjoy this sight exactly as it is. I don't understand how 1 person would want to ruin something so many people enjoy. Their our some other car sights that I have been on that I didn't like so I left! it's as simple as that.<P> finnaly I hope you change your mind but if you don't I would just like to say Thank you cliff for your time and money that you invested in this board without any hope of a return. <BR>            <P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif">         <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||5
