Z||000083||DecadenceR||07-05-2001||09:17 PM||||This is my first post in this thread, and is my last post in this thread. If anyone has a comment to direct towards me, please relay it via e-mail. Here is my opinion. No slander, no flaming, no name calling. Hopefully you all respect it.<P>We are all pretty much adults here. One major thing that sets us apart from animals is the ability to control our emotions. We're all part of this forum for information, meeting new people with a similar intrest, and such. Not to flame or defame each other. <P>I personally believe that it would be very prudent to just be adult about everything, and shake hands and let it drop. No one has to like each other, but I'm sure you can all exist peacefully in the same environment.<P>See ya.||||reg||1
